      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present 25 Pinewood Park, Rathfarnham, Dublin 14 to the market a substantial four-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential development. Pinewood Park is a well-established neighbourhood renowned for its peaceful surroundings and exceptional convenience. Residents are spoiled for choice with an excellent selection of local amenities nearby including Rathfarnham Shopping Centre, Nutgrove Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre, together with an array of cafés, restaurants and local shops. The area is also home to a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, while both Marlay Park and St. Enda's Park are within easy reach, offering fantastic recreational facilities. Excellent public transport links and convenient access to the M50 complete this superb family-friendly location.\n\nBright and generously proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c. 144 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, spacious lounge, living room, dining room, fully fitted kitchen, and utility room. The side garage was also converted, and was previously utilised as a fifth bedroom as it benefits from an ensuite. This adaptable space would also make an ideal home office, playroom, or TV room. Upstairs hosts four well-proportioned bedrooms together with a family bathroom.\n\nExternally, No. 25 enjoys excellent privacy, with the property not directly overlooked to the front. A private driveway provides ample off-street parking, while a side entrance leads to an exceptionally large rear garden laid in lawn, offering endless potential to extend (subject to the necessary planning permission). The garden is further enhanced by a block-built shed, providing excellent storage or workshop space.\n\nOffering generous family accommodation, exceptional versatility and outstanding potential in one of Rathfarnham's most desirable residential locations, No. 25 is sure to appeal to growing families seeking their forever home. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0861304080 or 012241630 to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 144 sqm\n• BER C\n• 4 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Semidetached home\n• Off street parking\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Perfect blank canvas\n• Extra large rear garden\n• Block built shed to the rear\n• Side entrance\n• Bright and airy\n• No onwards chain\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for growing families\n• Viewing highly advised\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D14 F381"
      },
      {
